  "content": "\n\n<h2>Tom 的簡單儲物模組</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/master/banner.png\" alt=\"Banner\"></p>\n<h3>這是本模組的 Forge/NeoForge 版本，若您正在尋找 Fabric 版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">專案連結</a></h3>\n<p>風格簡潔、貼近原版的儲物模組。<br>功能特色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>儲物與合成終端機</li>\n<li>物品欄連接器</li>\n<li>開蓋貨箱</li>\n<li>無線終端機</li>\n<li>過濾連接器</li>\n<li>物品欄漏斗</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若已安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-contraption-terminals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create 機械結構終端機</a>，終端機亦可用於 Create 模組的移動機構上。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/911/265/2024-07-08_01.png\" alt=\"Terminals on a Train\"></p>\n<p>模組介紹影片：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UoIi5q8kyo8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RwRKNhZ7uec?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nW5ElcWiC3c?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h3>依 Minecraft 與載入器版本分類下載：</h3>\n<p>1.21.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.21.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.21.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.6 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.3&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.3&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.18.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.17.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.16.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.15.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage/files?version=1.15.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/tom5454\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aEaIJ8A.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>",
